Z||000000||KRMFiero||07-30-2001||10:13 PM||||Alright i went to junk yard today and picked up a spoiler and 120 Guage cluster from a 2.8 1988 Formula, is this a direct plug in? complete speedo/tech/everything.    if not what do I have to do? will it plug into a 86 2.5 se? What is required to put aux cluster in?<P>Kyle<BR>||||reg||1
